📖 Surah Az-Zalzalah (The Earthquake)

Arabic: الزلزلة
Total Ayat: 8
Nazool: Aksar mufassireen ke nazdeek yeh Madani Surah hai.
Central Message: Qayamat ka Din aur har amal ka hisaab.

_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌍 Ayah 1: إِذَا زُلْزِلَتِ الْأَرْضُ زِلْزَالَهَا

Roman Urdu Tarjuma:
“Jab zameen apne poore zor ke saath hila di jaayegi.”

Tafseer:
Yahan Allah Ta‘ala Qayamat ke din ka manzar bayan kar rahe hain.
Zalzalah ka matlab hai — bohot zor ka hilaaw, aisi zalzalah jaisi duniya ne kabhi pehle nahi dekhi.
Yani jab Qayamat aayegi to puri zameen apne andar ki taqat se jhool uthegi, har cheez ulat-pulat ho jaayegi.
Ye wo waqt hoga jab sab kuch khatam kar diya jaayega — dukh, sukoon, sab kuch.

Sabak:
Allah Ta‘ala ki qudrat ka izhar. Koi bhi insani taqat is hilaaw ko nahi rok sakti. Humein Qayamat ke din ke liye tayyar rehna chahiye.

_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🏔️ Ayah 2: وَأَخْرَجَتِ الْأَرْضُ أَثْقَالَهَا

Roman Urdu Tarjuma:
“Aur zameen apne bojh nikal degi.”

Tafseer:
Zameen apne “asqaal” (bojh) nikaalegi — iska matlab hai sab lashain, khazane, aur insano ke amal zameen se zahir ho jaayenge.
Zameen sab kuch bahar nikaal degi jo uske andar chupaya gaya tha.
Kuch mufassireen kehte hain — “bojh” se murad logon ke amal ki gawahi bhi hai.

Sabak:
Kuch bhi hamesha chhupa nahi rehta. Ek din sab kuch zahir ho jaata hai.

_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

😨 Ayah 3: وَقَالَ الْإِنسَانُ مَا لَهَا

Roman Urdu Tarjuma:
“Aur insaan kahega: ‘Isay kya ho gaya?’”

Tafseer:
Insaan hairaan hoga, ghabra jaayega, jab wo zameen ko is halat mein dekhega.
Jo log duniya mein bekhabar the, wo bhi us din samjhenge ke ab sab kuch khatam ho gaya.
Har shakhs khauf aur confusion mein hoga.

Sabak:
Zindagi mein hum aksar Qayamat ko door samajhte hain, lekin wo lamha aayega jab sab kuch samne ho jaayega. Abhi se amal ki fikr karni chahiye.

_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌏 Ayah 4: يَوْمَئِذٍ تُحَدِّثُ أَخْبَارَهَا

Roman Urdu Tarjuma:
“Us din zameen apni khabrein bayan karegi.”

Tafseer:
Yani zameen bol uthegi aur batayegi ke iske upar kisne kya kiya.
Kahan namaz padi gayi, kahan gunaah hua, sab kuch wo gawahi degi.
Har jagah insaan ke amal likhe gaye hain — aur us din zameen sab bayan karegi.

Sabak:
Zameen bhi Allah ki makhlooq hai, jo uske hukum se gawahi degi. Isliye har jagah par nek amal karna chahiye.

_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

☝️ Ayah 5: بِأَنَّ رَبَّكَ أَوْحَىٰ لَهَا

Roman Urdu Tarjuma:
“Kyoon ke tere Rabb ne use hukum diya hoga.”

Tafseer:
Yani zameen apni marzi se nahi bolegi — Allah ka hukum hoga.
Jab Allah kahega “Batao,” to zameen bol uthegi.
Ye sab Allah ki qudrat aur insaf ka nizaam hai.

Sabak:
Har cheez Allah ke hukum se chalti hai. Zameen bhi Allah ki bandi hai.
Humein bhi apni zindagi Allah ke hukum ke mutabiq guzaarni chahiye.

_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

👥 Ayah 6: يَوْمَئِذٍ يَصْدُرُ النَّاسُ أَشْتَاتًا لِّيُرَوْا أَعْمَالَهُمْ

Roman Urdu Tarjuma:
“Us din log alag-alag groups mein nikalenge taake unhein unke aamaal dikhaye jaayen.”

Tafseer:
Qayamat ke din sab log jama honge, phir tabqon mein taqseem kiye jaayenge — mo’mineen, kafir, nek aur bad log alag honge.
Har shakhs ko uske amal ka nateeja dikhaya jaayega.
Kisi ka amal chhupa nahi rahega.

Sabak:
Is duniya mein hum logon ke status aur maal-daulat dekhte hain, lekin us din sirf amal ka hisaab chalega.

_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌸 Ayah 7: فَمَنْ يَعْمَلْ مِثْقَالَ ذَرَّةٍ خَيْرًا يَرَهُ

Roman Urdu Tarjuma:
“Jo shakhs ek zarrah (bohot chhoti) kadar bhi nek amal karega, wo usay zaroor dekhega.”

Tafseer:
Allah ne yahan ek azeem sach bayan kiya — koi bhi chhoti si nek amal bhi zaya nahi hoti.
Ek muskurahat, ek achi niyyat, ek dua — sab likha jaata hai.
Allah sab kuch dekh raha hai aur sab ka ajar dene wala hai.

Sabak:
Chhoti chhoti nekiyan kartay raho — Allah ke nazdeek wo bhi bohot badi hain.

_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🔥 Ayah 8: وَمَنْ يَعْمَلْ مِثْقَالَ ذَرَّةٍ شَرًّا يَرَهُ

Roman Urdu Tarjuma:
“Aur jo shakhs ek zarrah barabar bhi burai karega, wo usay bhi dekhega.”

Tafseer:
Jaise nek amal likhe jaate hain, waise hi buraiyan bhi likhi jaati hain.
Ek chhoti jhoot, ghina, hasad — sab ka hisaab hoga.
Allah ke insaaf mein koi chhoti ya badi cheez chhupi nahi rahegi.

Sabak:
Har amal ki ahmiyat samajho. Har burai se bacho, chahe wo chhoti lage, kyunki Allah ke nazdeek sab ka hisaab hai.

_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌿 Mukhtasir Nateeja (Conclusion)

Surah Az-Zalzalah humein yaad dilati hai:

Har amal likha ja raha hai.
Har insaan apne amal ka anjaam dekhega.
Allah ka insaaf bilkul barabar hoga.
Duniya fani hai, Qayamat haq hai.
Is Surah se humein taqwa, imaandari aur khauf-e-Khuda seekhna chahiye.
Har din apne amal ka hisaab lena chahiye, taake us din asaani ho.
